---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Rebuilds a pinned bundle from its own source and dependencies and compares the executable; also compares the source with its Git commit

Usage: leptoskit verify reproduce [OPTIONS] --bundle <BUNDLE> --manifest <MANIFEST> --sha256 <SHA256>

Options:
      --bundle <BUNDLE>
          The extracted backend bundle directory

      --manifest <MANIFEST>
          The inventory written with the bundle

      --sha256 <SHA256>
          The expected inventory digest, obtained independently of the bundle

      --checkout <CHECKOUT>
          Compare the source with this local clone instead of fetching the recipe's commit from its repository

      --offline
          Skip the steps that need the network: fetching the commit and re-resolving dependencies. Only the executable is rebuilt

      --engine <ENGINE>
          The container engine. Defaults to docker, then podman, whichever responds

          Possible values:
          - docker: Docker
          - podman: Podman

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
